  "summary": "If you're running a B2B industrial manufacturer or distributor doing over $10M - $100M in revenue in the U.S., you know how much harder it has become to find buyers for your products. \n\nYou can't just stroll in the door anymore. Trade shows are not as successful anymore. International competition is growing.\n\nBy talking to companies like GROB, United Grinding, and ANCA, I realized that sales teams need to be proactive and be with the buyer from day 1.\n\nThat's why we built SUPPLYCO AI.\n\nWe give industrial manufacturers the power to find 1000 qualified factory leads in minutes - AND stay up to date on anything that is happening in their territory.\n\nSome of the biggest multinational manufacturers use our product. Their feedback becomes our newest features. We have always been building with the industry.\n\nDM me \"AI\" if you want to understand how this can work for you.",
